# Ruleset: Banks, proxied
#
# Expects a proxy policy. Must precede Bank/Direct.list, whose mainland suffixes would otherwise take CCB Asia and BoCom Hong Kong.
#
# A bank ties a session to the address it sees, so each bank takes one path for its whole estate, decided by name. Hong Kong and foreign banks take the proxy. GEOIP can split them: mainland resolvers hand some bank edges a mainland or Alibaba anycast address, sending those direct while the rest of the bank takes the proxy.
#
# Analytics hosts such as smetrics.sc.com, svc2.sc.com, omns.americanexpress.com and analytics.chase.com are rejected by the reject layer, which this file follows, and stay rejected.
#
# Scope: Hong Kong retail and virtual banks, and foreign banks. A Hong Kong arm with its own Hong Kong infrastructure belongs here even when a host sits under its mainland parent's zone: CCB Asia's www.asia.ccb.com resolves into CCB's Hong Kong network (AS38475), and BoCom Hong Kong's hk.bankcomm.com into the same Hong Kong range as bankcomm.com.hk. AlipayHK is a Hong Kong stored value licensee and sits here with HSBC's PayMe. Card networks are not banks and stay unclassified.

# Hong Kong retail banks. HSBC's PayMe lives on HSBC's own top-level domain.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hangseng.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sc.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,citibank.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dbs.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dbs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hkbea.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chiyubank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ncb.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dahsing.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chbank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fubonbank.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,shacombank.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ocbc.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,publicbank.com.hk

# Hong Kong arms of mainland banks that run their own Hong Kong infrastructure
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,asia.ccb.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ccbasia.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hk.bankcomm.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bankcomm.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cmbwinglungbank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cncbinternational.com

# Hong Kong virtual banks
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,za.group
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mox.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,livibank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,welab.bank
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,airstarbank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fusionbank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paob.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antbank.hk

# Hong Kong stored value
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipay.hk

# Foreign banks
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,americanexpress.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aexp-static.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chase.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,barclays.co.uk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,barclays.com
